{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S01、S02等段的感受词较密，意象切换也多，快速扫读时容易被局部细节分散；X固定的左右栏结构更利于快速浏览。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的叙述连贯、左右分区稳定，扫起来更省力，但长句较多，缺少视觉上的重点提示。Y用加亮词迅速标出每段心理变化，又通过随音乐出现的感受词补足情绪转折、身体体验和音乐细节，尤其S06至S14，把从害怕失去、渴望互相依靠到接受不确定性的变化呈现得更细致。虽然局部信息偏密，但综合理解人物、把握情绪发展和感受细腻度，Y更有优势。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d48ce34b-02d2-4a32-b231-b068ae163c7f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T043443814829Z", "elapsed_seconds": 63.406, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T04:35:47.223338+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0ee78682b41cc454c125ca48c82436d783f29ce1b3a7e0c809f484357582814f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachment